<title>POLAND: TENNIS-POLAND BEAT GHANA 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-POLAND BEAT GHANA 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>POZNAN, Poland 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland completed a 5-0 victory over Ghana in their Davis Cup Euro/Africa zone group two, first round tie after winning both reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results: Krystian Pfeiffer beat Nortey Dowuoma 6-1 6-1 Filip Aniol beat Alex Orofi 6-1 6-0</p>
